 of cervical infection with human papillomaviruses and cervical dysplasia in Alaska Native women</article-title><source>J Infect Dis</source><year>1994</year><volume>169</volume><fpage>792</fpage><lpage>800</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Infect Dis||169|792||bib5|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8133094</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Forslund</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Antonsson</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Edlund</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>van den Brule</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hansson</surname><given-names>BG</given-names></name><name><surname>Meijer</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ryd</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Rylander</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Strand</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Wadell</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Dillner</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Johansson</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Population-based type-specific prevalence of high-risk human papillomavirus infection in middle-aged Swedish women</article-title><source>J Med Virol</source><year>2002</year><volume>66</volume><fpage>535</fpage><lpage>541</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Med Virol||66|535||bib6|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11857534</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gravitt</surname><given-names>PE</given-names></name><name><surname>Burk</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name><name><surname>Lorincz</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Herrero</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Hildesheim</su